    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate Oliver McGowan training on learning disabilities & autism in education",
        "additional_details": "Thousands of DWP health care professionals completed the training and we believe education staff should be required to complete the same training. As a Tier 2 Co-Trainer, I have seen how lived-experience training transforms professionals. It could reduce trauma, improve inclusion and secure Oliver\u2019s legacy.",
        "background": "Make Oliver McGowan Mandatory Training compulsory for all staff members in all education settings, ensuring staff are equipped to support autistic pupils and reduce trauma, misunderstanding and exclusion.",
